  "step_3": "The decision reason focuses solely on the probability of the maximum outcome and prefers the lottery with the higher such probability (A, at 34%). The individual did consider the probabilities of the main outcomes (34% vs. 33%), which aligns with the information relevant to the reason. However, their justification does not follow the rule of the decision reason. Instead of preferring A for its higher probability of the maximum outcome, they reject that trade-off because the 1% gain is not worth 100€ less. This indicates that the individual weighed both payoff and probability, and ultimately used a compensatory trade-off, not a rule based solely on maximizing the probability of the best outcome. Therefore, while the relevant information was considered, the rule of the decision reason was not applied in the justification.",
  "final_assessment_score": 20
